WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
One flight. Seats at €180, €240 and €300.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The bots search. The price stays at €180.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
They hold 2 seats. Some €180 tickets remain.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The €180 seats are held. The price rises to €240.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Two more seats are held. The price stays at €240.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
No €240 seats remain available. The price rises to €300.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The bots release the seats. The price returns to €180.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Holding the cheapest seats can raise the price.
